 "description": "This is my first attempt at a classic Deal Deck.  I really need some help on further optomizing its capabilities.  Any help would be most gracious.",
 "strategy": "Once again, this is my first try at something like this.  I need to know what I need to cull out.  I keep looking at it, and for some reason, it just doesn't look great to me.  I've got some ideas on what I should/would/could do, but I'd like some feedback before I go and make changes.  I'd like to thank challenger...he sent me emails a few months ago going into great detail on how this deck should be played.  I've finally acquired the cards, and now I'd like to play it competetively.  Enjoy!\n\nIs my character selection okay?\n\nShould I find a way to put in Blaster Rack (v)?\n\nWho should I drop from space?\n\nWho should I drop from land?\n\nWhat should I add?\n\nDoes the red look descent?\n\nWhat aliens should I add?  (keep in mind it's classic!)\n\nI know that in the end it is my choice on how my deck should be built.  But am I missing key ingredients?  Or is this okay?  About the only thing I'm fully confident in is the destiny of this deck!  (Avg 3.56, Avg 4.55 if Lando (v) on table!)  Thanks for any feedback and consideration towards this deck!\n\nPEGD",
